sequenceDiagram
    participant Test as Test Script
    participant Src as odc-video-source
    participant Daemon as odc-onboard Daemon
    participant Mgr as RtspCompressorManager
    participant Bridge as RtspBridge
    participant Client as odc-rtsp-monitor

    Note over Src: Serves mercedes.mp4 on loop
    Test->>Src: ./odc-video-source --video mercedes.mp4 --port 19554
    Src-->>Src: GStreamer: filesrc → parse → rtph264pay → RTSP server
    Src-->>Test: Listening on rtsp://127.0.0.1:19554/source

    Test->>Daemon: start daemon (rtsp: enabled, auto_start_on_vpn: true)

    Note over Test: Trigger compressor — assign IP to loopback
    Test->>Test: ip addr add 10.77.7.1/24 dev lo
    Test->>Daemon: Netlink address event detected
    Daemon->>Mgr: Auto-spawn compressor

    Note over Bridge: Transcode pipeline starts
    Mgr->>Bridge: bridge->start(input_uri=rtsp://127.0.0.1:19554/source)

    Note over Bridge: GStreamer ingest: rtspsrc → decode → encode h265 → RTSP serve
    Bridge-->>Daemon: output: rtsp://0.0.0.0:8554/stream

    Test->>Client: ./odc-rtsp-monitor rtsp://127.0.0.1:8554/stream --tcp --duration 5
    Client->>Bridge: RTSP DESCRIBE / SETUP / PLAY
    Bridge-->>Client: RTP video stream (H.265 720p 800kbps)
    Client->>Client: Pad probe measures bandwidth every 500ms
    Client-->>Test: Avg Bandwidth: 750.3 kbps, Total Frames: 287

    Test->>Daemon: CLI: rtsp stop compressor
    Daemon->>Bridge: g_main_loop_quit + bridge->stop()
    Bridge-->>Bridge: Tear down GStreamer pipeline

    Test->>Src: kill video source
    Test->>Daemon: kill daemon
